mode: "100644"
text: "# voice.md\n\nCopy this to `~/.claude/x/voice.md` and fill it in. Every skill in the pack\nreads it. Ten minutes here is the difference between drafts you post and\ndrafts you rewrite.\n\nIf you would rather not fill it in by hand, paste five of your own recent\nposts into Claude and say \"write my voice.md from these\". That works better\nthan guessing at the answers.\n\n---\n\n## Who I am\n\n- **Name and handle:**\n- **What I do, in one sentence:**\n- **Who I am writing for:** (be specific: \"solo founders under $1M ARR\", not \"entrepreneurs\")\n- **What I sell, if anything:**\n\n## What I sound like on X\n\n- **Five of my own posts that sound most like me:** (paste them)\n- **Capitalisation:** (normal / all lowercase / whatever I feel like)\n- **Words I actually use:**\n- **Words I would never use:**\n- **Line length:** (one-liners / short stacked lines / paragraphs)\n- **Do I swear:** (yes / mild / no)\n- **Emoji:** (never / one, rarely / freely)\n- **Threads or long posts:** (threads / long posts with Premium / neither)\n\n## My positions\n\nThree to five things I believe that some of my audience does not. These are\nwhere the posts people reply to come from.\n\n1.\n2.\n3.\n\n## My niche\n\n- **Accounts I read every day:** (these seed /x-viral and /x-plan)\n- **Accounts about my size I would like as peers:**\n- **Accounts that could buy from me:**\n\n## Off limits\n\n- **Topics I do not post about:**\n- **Clients, numbers or names I cannot share publicly:**\n- **Claims I am not allowed to make:** (regulated industry, employer policy, NDA)\n\n## Proof I can use\n\nReal numbers, outcomes and stories I am happy to put my name on. The skills\nwill never invent one, so if this section is empty, every draft comes back\nwith `{{your number}}` in it.\n\n-\n-\n-\n"
